# L §7.6 item 2 (tally 2.1.6, P30 on T's SR-T2 of #89), a twin: 1..1000000 holds 1 000 000 keys, within the limit, so
# load counts it and refuses nothing, and q answers. Both 2.1.6 refcores answer so.
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-02
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-01-05

source s "s"

input x: int

ask q: x

ask many: max(k for k in 1..1000000)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  x = 1
=== expect q
q: 1
  cut 2026-01-02
